within Pharmacolibrary.Drugs.C_CardiovascularSystem.C01D_VasodilatorsUsedInCardiacDiseases.C01DX16_Nicorandil;
model Nicorandil_Iida2008v2_PD_pawp
  "emax exposure-response sweep — Iida_2008_2 :: PAWP (pulmonary artery wedge pressure)"
  extends Pharmacolibrary.Pharmacodynamic.SigmoidEmaxSweep(
    E0 = 25.6,      // [mmHg]
    Emax = -11.7,  // [mmHg]
    EC50 = 0.423,  // [kg/m3; mg l -1 × 0.001]
    gamma = 1,
    exposure_per_s = 0.001);   // 1 mg l -1 per second
  // imax_as_negative_emax: Imax (Q323) enters SigmoidEmaxSweep as −Emax
  // defaulted: gamma
  annotation(experiment(StartTime = 0, StopTime = 4300, Interval = 8.6),
    Documentation(info = "<html><body><h4>Nicorandil_Iida2008v2_PD_pawp</h4><p>The steady-state exposure-response curve of Iida S et al., <i>British journal of clinical pharmacology 66(3):352–365</i> 2008 (<a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1111/j.1365-2125.2008.03257.x\">doi:10.1111/j.1365-2125.2008.03257.x</a>) — pulmonary artery wedge pressure [mmHg] against nicorandil mg l -1 — obtained by sweeping the driver instead of simulating a dose. Model family: emax.</p><h4>The parameters, in the paper's terms</h4><pre>  E0    =       25.6 mmHg     drug-free response (baseline) (Baseline PAWP, Q324)
  Emax  =      -11.7 mmHg     maximal effect term (Maximum effect of nicorandil on PAWP, Q323)
  EC50  =        423 mg l -1  exposure at half of the maximal effect term (Nicorandil concentration at 50% of Emax, Q321)
  gamma = (library default) Hill coefficient</pre><p>The algebra is <a href=\"modelica://Pharmacolibrary.Pharmacodynamic.SigmoidEmaxSweep\">SigmoidEmaxSweep</a>; this model only supplies the numbers. The x axis is one mg l -1 of nicorandil per second of simulated time (exposure is in kg/m3): there is no state, no dose and no kinetics — plot <code>response</code> against <code>exposure</code> (or <code>time</code>).</p><h4>What it reproduces</h4><pre>  exposure = 0         response 25.6   (drug-free)
  exposure = EC50 (423 mg l -1)  response 19.75
  exposure -> infinity  response 13.9</pre></body></html>", revisions = "<html><body><ul><li>11/2026 generated by pharmacolibrary-dev export.pharmacolibrary_models from Iida_2008_2: parameters extracted from the paper by the pharmacolibrary-dev pipeline, model built by its engineer, reviewed: accepted with caveats</li></ul></body></html>"));
end Nicorandil_Iida2008v2_PD_pawp;
